# Settings shared by every build mode (web, desktop, pick-rates).
#
# GoatCounter site code for anonymous usage counting — the "MYCODE" part of
# https://MYCODE.goatcounter.com. Not a secret: it is visible in every request.
# Left empty, counting is off entirely: no request is made and the Settings toggle
# is hidden. See src/analytics.ts and README "Privacy".
#
# BEFORE filling this in: in the GoatCounter site's Settings → Data collection,
# turn OFF User-Agent, Country and Region. README "Privacy" promises those are
# not recorded, and GoatCounter records them by default.
VITE_GOATCOUNTER_CODE=m0obot
